// Verbatim (functionally) copy of the existing Kumbaya intake prototype from
// https://ramprate-event-intake.eclecticexe.chatgpt.site - design, scoring rubric,
// sponsor-pitch prototype generator, and noindex/nofollow/noarchive meta directives
// are all preserved unchanged, per explicit instruction not to rebuild the visual
// interface. Only the submit handler was touched: it now POSTs to
// /api/kumbaya-intake instead of opening a mailto: link, a hidden honeypot field
// was added for spam protection, and the consent checkbox was given a real
// name="consent" (it previously had no `name` at all, so it was never actually
// submitted anywhere). Stored as an escaped template string rather than a sibling
// .html file read via fs at request time, since Netlify's serverless build tracing
// for Next.js isn't guaranteed to bundle an fs-read static asset - a string import
// has zero risk of a working-locally-but-404-in-production gap.
